      <t anchor="req-1">A lock <bcp14>must</bcp14> start locked.</t>
      <t anchor="req-2">A lock <bcp14>MIGHT</bcp14> refuse a code.</t>
      <t anchor="req-3">A lock <bcp14>SHOULD NOT</bcp14> stay unlocked.</t>
